longchain32	CNAME	longchain33.example.com.
longchain33	CNAME	longchain34.example.com.
longchain34	CNAME	longchain35.example.com.
longchain35	CNAME	longchain36.example.com.
longchain36	CNAME	longchain37.example.com.
longchain37	CNAME	longchain38.example.com.
longchain38	CNAME	longchain39.example.com.
longchain39	CNAME	longchain40.example.com.
